<title>UK: IBCA rates BBV Int'l Finance FRNs AA minus.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates BBV Int'l Finance FRNs AA minus.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Thursday it assigned a long-term rating of AA minus to the $200 million subordinated FRNs November 2006 issued by BBV International Finance Ltd.</p>
<p>The issue is guaranteed by Banco Bilbao Vizcaya, IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
</text>
